admin.quest.compensation.resolve|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.control.write|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.definition.activate|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.definition.create|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.definition.delete|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.definition.publish|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.definition.update|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.migration.execute|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
admin.quest.quarantine.replay|TLE capability (write): quest-administration
