admin.security.rate_limit.write|TLE capability (write): gateway-security-operations
admin.social.guild.manage|TLE capability (write): social-administration
admin.social.moderate|TLE capability (write): social-administration
admin.social.outbox.replay|TLE capability (write): social-administration
admin.social.read|TLE capability (read): social-administration
admin.timeline.read|TLE capability (read): timeline-administration
admin.timeline.replay|TLE capability (write): timeline-administration
admin.valkey.evict|TLE capability (write): valkey-administration
admin.valkey.read|TLE capability (read): valkey-administration
'

BUNDLES='
support|Player support and moderation: reads player-facing state, revokes player sessions, moderates lobby and social.
operator|Day-to-day live operations: support plus infrastructure reads, player corrections, queue and match interventions, content drafting and replays.
admin|Platform owner: every operator capability, including key rotation, kill switch, publishing and activation, destructive infrastructure actions and policy changes.
'

# bundle|capability, flattened (includes already resolved by the manifest).
MEMBERS='
support|admin.auth.read
support|admin.auth.sessions.read
support|admin.auth.sessions.revoke
support|admin.game.read
support|admin.lobby.moderate
support|admin.lobby.read
